'''Scalewolf Curse''' is a forbidden spell that permanently causes someone's body to be transformed. In the case of [[Euini]], he was turned into a [[Scalewolf]].

==Description==
The spell contains a sigil identical to one in the [[Illusory Labyrinth]] spell, this sigil being made up of three dots arranged in a triangle shape, but other than that, all of its sigils and signs are unknown. When it was used on Euini, the spell transformed him into a scalewolf. This happened as a result of the [[Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade]] he was wearing fusing with him, as the cloak contained the fur and scales of a Scalewolf.

==Usage==
The spell's first and only known use was by [[Sasaran]], a Brimmed Cap Witch, during the events at [[Serpentback Cave Arc|Serpentback Cave]]. [[Sasaran]] used the spell on Euini, forcibly fusing him with his cloak, resulting in his transforming into a scalewolf.

